# 9. Calendar mutation QA checklist

Use this checklist for any command that can write, update, or delete:

1. Confirm mutation intent: `add/create/schedule/write/update/delete/clear/wipe`.
2. Resolve athlete, date, sport, title, and scope.
3. For sport-specific workouts, lock sport first.
4. Use strict Intervals.icu syntax.
5. Validate duration integrity.
6. Validate exactly one intensity anchor per interval.
7. Prefer workout-library templates before custom generation.
8. Do not pass estimated TSS for library workouts unless the command explicitly supplies real TSS.
9. For replacement, match by ID first; otherwise same date + same sport/type + strong title similarity.
10. Delete → verify → create for replacements.
11. Never date-delete unless user explicitly says `clear day`, `delete all`, `remove everything`, or `wipe`.
12. Report exactly what was changed.
